    <h1>Protein and Weight Loss After 40 <span class="accent">(Your Target Goes Up, Not Down)</span></h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">Most men over 40 cut calories and lose the wrong thing. Here's why protein is what determines whether you lose fat or muscle — and why dieting actually raises your protein requirement.</p>
